    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Regional Processing\n\nThe regional outputs below are placeholders for region-specific processing in a real-world workflow.\n\n* **North → ProcessNorth**: Send to the North region processing team/system\n* **South → ProcessSouth**: Send to the South region processing team/system\n* **East → ProcessEast**: Send to the East region processing team/system\n* **West → ProcessWest**: Send to the West region processing team/system\n* **Fallback → ProcessFallback**: Handle orders with an unknown or unsupported region\n\nIn a production workflow, each route could connect to region-specific services, queues, databases, notifications, or business logic.\n",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 512
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1440,
        576
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
